@startuml UC-69
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-69.md
title UC-69: Top Selling Products
footer Feature DASH-03 | Business rules: BR-07, BR-40
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Admin" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "Admin/DashboardController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "DashboardService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

note over API : Requires role: Admin

U -> MVC : Choose period and number of products
MVC -> API : GET /api/admin/dashboard/top-products?from={from}&to={to}&top={n}
API -> SVC : GetTopProductsAsync(from, to, n)
SVC -> DB : SUM(OrderItems.Quantity) per product for orders\nnot Canceled and CreatedAt in period\nORDER BY quantity DESC, TOP n (BR-40)
DB --> SVC : Aggregated rows
SVC -> SVC : Fill missing periods with zero
SVC --> API : TopProductDto[]
API --> MVC : 200 OK
MVC --> U : Show chart and table

@enduml
